# Ad-hoc suite runs write results/<suite>.json; commit a compare run's
# directory deliberately (summary.md, JSONs, logs), never the Go binary
# built into it.
results/*.json
results/compare/*/gobench
gobench/gobench
# ...and keep a committed run's logs (the root .gitignore drops *.log):
# they hold the evidence, e.g. multishot "opened=256 fell_back=0".
!results/compare/*/*.log
